homelab-drive (0.1.22) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Release v0.1.22

 -- Gardner <gardner@homelab>  Fri, 11 Sep 2026 19:42:10 -0500

homelab-drive (0.1.22) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix: enqueue() from Homelab::Common::AuditClient was imported into
    the wrong package -- App.pm declares Homelab::Drive::App at the top
    but all the route handlers (delete_file, api_delete, bulk_delete)
    live in a second package, Homelab::Drive::App::Controller::Drive,
    further down the same file. Perl `use` imports are scoped to the
    package active at the point of the `use`, not file-global, so the
    import needs to live in the second package block too -- the exact
    same class of bug this file already has a comment warning about
    (see the note above the controller package's own imports).

 -- Gardner <gardner@homelab>  Fri, 11 Sep 2026 19:36:32 -0500

